<h2 id="includes">What This Service Includes</h2>
<p>Consistent inputs make measurement possible. Because every case follows the same standardized protocol, your program's outcomes can be tracked against validated measures rather than anecdotes. We build the tracking, the dashboards, and the reporting that turn day-to-day treatment into data you can actually use.</p>

<h3>What We Set Up</h3>
<div class="dash-list">
