<h2 id="track">What We Track</h2>
<p>Tracking is built around measures that mean something clinically and operationally — patient-reported outcomes, program throughput, and quality indicators tied to how the protocol is delivered. The point is to give your practice a clear, honest picture of its own results over time.</p>

<div class="callout">
  <div class="callout-label">On outcomes data</div>
  <p class="callout-body">Regenitiva has a formal outcomes study in progress, and we don't market unverified statistics as claims. What this service gives you is the infrastructure to measure your own program accurately — the same commitment to real evidence, applied to your practice.</p>
</div>

<h2 id="dashboards">Dashboards &amp; Reporting</h2>
<p>Data only helps if you can see it. We build dashboards and reporting that surface the numbers that matter to the people who need them — clinical leads, operators, and ownership — so the program is managed by what's actually happening rather than by impression.</p>

